{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cult of Shadows is a dynamic action game combining elements from the Hack and Slash and Roguelite genres. Fight hordes of enemies and gain experience. Strengthen your character and skills. Defeat cultists and the Mythos they summon. Collect and upgrade items, obtain unique items, and use them in battles in dark arenas and procedurally generated dungeons. Unlock new heroes and test new builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What can you expect in Cult of Shadows?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting large numbers of enemies simultaneously,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mighty beasts to defeat,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improving your character's attributes and skills,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of dying and coming back,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting items\u2014common, magical, blessed or cursed, and unique,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading your items,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting in arenas and procedurally generated dungeons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will you find in the game?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique levels,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 procedurally generated dungeons,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters with unique skills,</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936450?t=1759851536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936450?t=1759851536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/4014ffb15d032594db787d95148a5b1f717e14f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759851536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936450/4014ffb15d032594db787